#: understeer/settings.py:93
msgid "Mechanical damping added by the wheelbase itself, independent of the game."
msgstr "Mechanische Dämpfung durch die Wheelbase selbst, unabhängig vom Spiel."

#: understeer/settings.py:97
msgid "Natural Friction"
msgstr "Natürliche Reibung"

#: understeer/settings.py:98
msgid "Mechanical friction added by the wheelbase itself, independent of the game."
